  "description": "Mia has always been fascinated by kinky behavior. But because of her social status, appearance, and demeanor, no one is willing to talk to her about such things. Even the occasional flirtation she receives instinctively feels like an insult to her, so she ends up treating people harshly—only to regret it later—in a never-ending cycle. Realizing she can’t go on like this, Mia decides to seek out Claude, who is famous among women...\n\n *“Excuse me, I’m Mia Triang, and I’m here to win Claude over.”*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
